# Product docs

This project separates product intent from architecture:

| Document | Role |
|----------|------|
| [abstract.md](../../abstract.md) | Vision and product language |
| [docs/requirements.md](../../docs/requirements.md) | Living requirements (edit in place) |
| [docs/pdr/](../../docs/pdr/) | Product decision records (*what* the product is) |
| `docs/adr/` | Architecture decision records (*how* we build it), when they exist |

Write a PDR only when there were real alternatives whose rationale would otherwise be lost. Follow the **product-decision-records** skill for PDR files and the **architecture-decision-records** skill for ADRs.

Do not put product vocabulary or product requirement decisions in `docs/adr/`.
